    "This update added:\n1. Animations on Quadratic\n2. Sidebar on iPad and Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 二次函数动画\n2. 侧栏"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n二次方程動畫\n側欄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update added:\n1. Area calculations\n2. Optimize code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 面积计算\n2. 优化代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update added:\n1. Binary to Denary and inversely conversion\n2. Adaptation to iOS 26 Liquid Glass" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 二进制与十进制及反向转换\n2. 适配 iOS 26 Liquid Glass 界面"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n二進位與十進位之間的雙向換算\n適應 iOS 26 Liquid Glass 設計風格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update added:\n1. Binary to Denary and inversely conversion\n2. Adaptation to iOS 26 Liquid Glass\n\nKnown Issues:\n1. Conversion does not convert negative numbers\n2. Decimal point can be entered in Conversion and will return a wrong value" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update added:\n1. Binary to denary conversion and vice versa\n2. Adaptation to iOS 26 Liquid Glass\n\nKnown issues:\n1. Conversion does not support negative numbers\n2. Decimal points can be entered during conversion and may return incorrect values"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 二进制与十进制及反向转换\n2. 适配 iOS 26 Liquid Glass\n\n已知问题：\n1. 转换功能无法转换负数\n2. 转换过程中可以输入小数点，但会返回错误值"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n二進位與十進位之間的雙向換算適應\niOS 26 Liquid Glass 設計風格\n\n已知問題：\n換算功能目前不支援負數轉換\n在換算模式中可以輸入小數點，但會返回錯誤的數值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update added:\n1. Conversion of Number systems\n2. Better use on Liquid Glass\n3. More localization" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update added:\n1. Number system conversion\n2. Improved use of Liquid Glass\n3. More localisation"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 进制转换\n2. 更佳的 Liquid Glass 使用体验\n3. 更精准的翻译"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n進位制換算\n優化 Liquid Glass 的操作體驗\n完善其他語言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update added:\n1. Finding 2 unknowns of Linear Simultaneous Equation\n2. Length Conversion\n3. Rounding up values on other modes\n4. Distinguish modes in main menu\n5. Improved entering values in in Sequence as keyboard users now can return to go to next TextField" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update added:\n1. Finding two unknowns in linear simultaneous equations\n2. Length conversion\n3. Rounding values in other modes\n4. Distinguishing modes in the main menu\n5. Improved value entry in sequences, as keyboard users can now press Return to move to the next TextField"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 求解二元一次方程组\n2. 长度转换\n3. 其他模式下数值向上取整\n4. 主菜单中模式区分\n5. 改进了按顺序输入数值的功能，键盘用户现在可以返回到下一个文本框"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n解二元一次聯立方程式\n長度單位換算\n在其他模式進位數值以縮短\n在主選單中區分不同模式\n優化數列模式的數值輸入體驗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update added:\n1. Finding unknown from Simple or Compound interest\n2. New Icon" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update added:\n1. Finding unknown values from simple or compound interest\n2. New icon"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 计算单利或复利未知数\n2. 新图标"
